.TH WERKMEISTER-SERVICES 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-services \- List services and their endpoints for a feature
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister services\fR <feature>
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Shows each service with its source (local container or k8s forward) and endpoint:
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
  Service                Source    Endpoint              Type
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  backend             k8s      localhost:9052         api
  frontend             local    localhost:11101        web
.RE
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
